    "description": "A student asks a question late at night. The teacher marks a paragraph in Presmium and has the AI add an animation; the same figure is taught step by step in class, read on the course website and sent as a video, and the student replies \"Got it\". Music: \"Newer Wave\" by Kevin MacLeod (incompetech.com), CC BY 4.0.",
